Hey there! 

So I understand why it's damn near impossible to analyse the sound output, and that's to prevent bad people from stealing music - that's why everything's wrapped up in a neat iframe. But this makes the whole "visualiser" thing super difficult. So without explicitly exposing the ability to access the content itself, what about exposing an `AnalyserNode` or even the methods it provides to allow us to create visualisers? Obviously, the SDAs will need to adhere to the Developer Terms of Service, but this will allow us to make some nifty things other than ordinary wrappers. 

Thoughts?

